* Design the function to be easily extensible for future data types and integration points without significant refactoring. The `Octree` class is designed to be highly flexible and can be easily extended to support new data types or integration points without requiring significant changes to the existing codebase.
* Ensure thread safety and efficient synchronization when multiple threads access the octree simultaneously. The `Octree` class uses a mutex to ensure that only one thread can access the octree at a time, which minimizes contention and improves performance.']

