The function also includes validation to ensure that the IP address format is correct and that no two configurations share the same `InterfaceID`. If any errors are encountered during configuration initialization, the function logs an error message to a file named `error.log` located in the application's working directory. The logging mechanism is thread-safe to prevent race conditions when accessed by multiple threads simultaneously.

