The system also includes a mechanism for monitoring and automatically addressing resource bottlenecks, which can help maintain optimal performance under varying load conditions. The `ExecutorService` is used to schedule message delivery tasks, and the `MAX_CONCURRENT_REQUESTS` constant controls the maximum number of concurrent requests that can be executed at any given time.

