      for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {
          pdus[i].rnti = generate_rnti();
          generate_crc_indication(&pdus[i]);
      }
      return pdus;
  }
  ```

  This example suffers from potential memory leaks and does not handle PDUs of different types.

---

Incorporate these considerations into the function design while ensuring robustness and maintainability.

