Here is a sample C program that dynamically processes video files specified via command line arguments, handling each file type appropriately, extracting frames and summarizing key metadata such as resolution, frame rate, and duration. The program also includes logging capabilities to track the execution process, recording detailed information such as file names, metadata, processing times, and any errors encountered.
